        <dc:title>Detecting inorganic financial campaigns on Twitter</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Online financial content is widespread on social media, especially on Twitter. The possibility to access open, real-time data about stock market information and firms’ public reputation can bring competitive advantages to industry insiders. However, as many studies extensively demonstrated before, manipulative campaigns by social bots do not spare the financial sector either.</dcterms:abstract>
